==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 3~10 seconds<sup>90f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 6~26.67 seconds<sup>180f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 6~16.67 seconds<sup>180f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
**10 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just push the Doges with your long-ranged and/or wave attackers and pray that Dober P.D. won't destroy your entire stack.

[[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Cats with Wave Immunity]] make this stage markedly easier. If you have one of those as well as a Cat that possesses [[Critical Hit]]s and Area Attacks ([[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] is a perfect example), this stage will be steamrolled. [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave blocking Cats]] such as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] (if on four Crowns) work brilliantly as they can nullify Dober's Waves entirely.

